WEBVTT

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:13.130
<i>Amazing.</i>

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:15.420
<i>I'm keeping those two behind me.</i>

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.050
<i>But... the battle starts here.</i>

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:26.520
<i>The third man</i>

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.540
<i>Amazing, Reina!</i>

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.200
<i>You're so cute!</i>

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:38.410
<i>I better get her autograph now.</i>

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:40.200
<i>Ah, me too!</i>

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:44.210
<i>Everyone, let me introduce you.</i>

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:48.660
<i>This is Akikawa Reina, she'll be working with us.</i>

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.360
<i>Pleased to meet you.</i>

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:52.450
<i>Nice to meet you, do your best!</i>

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.080
<i>Ok! I'll do my best.</i>

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:04.890
<i>Smile a little more.</i>

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.040
<i>More!</i>

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:09.460
<i>Yeah, just like that!</i>

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.030
<i>You're so cute! Good, good! </i>

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:15.020
<i>Wah! You're so cute, Reina.</i>

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:16.690
<i>You seem so different.</i>

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:18.750
<i>Reina, you're so pretty now.</i>

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:22.120
<i>I'm jealous, you guys are in college.</i>

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.710
<i>What are you talking about?
You have it so much better.</i>

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:26.990
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:30.400
<i>Smile.</i>

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:32.040
<i>A little more.</i>

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:34.300
<i>Look this way.</i>

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.050
<i>Lift your hair up.</i>

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:39.310
<i>It's hard to breathe...</i>

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:41.800
<i>I feel like throwing up.</i>

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:48.320
<i>Then, what is it you want the
most right now, Reina-chan?</i>

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:51.000
<i>Oh, nothing really...</i>

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.920
<i>When did I become so alone?</i>

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:05.160
<i>When did I seclude myself like this?</i>

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.900
<i>Tell me, GT-R...</i>

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:15.400
<i>My true feelings.</i>

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:20.910
<i>What is it that I seek?</i>

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:25.770
<i>Why am I driving right now?</i>

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:27.880
<i>I don't understand!</i>

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:32.400
<i>Before, I was able to forget everything when I drove here.</i>

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:35.170
<i>But now...</i>

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:37.860
<i>Now, it's different!</i>

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.870
<i>I'm different from those two.</i>

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:52.370
<i>But I have to drive.</i>

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:01.880
<i>This is where the battle begins.</i>

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.400
<i>I'm holding them back...</i>

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.820
<i>You can do it, right, GT-R?</i>

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:57.980
<i>Why am I driving on Wangan!?</i>

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:00.030
<i>Please... tell me!</i>

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.170
Are you ok? Are you hurt?

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:23.720
Please, tell me...

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:27.970
Why do you drive here?

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:33.980
Please... tell me.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:37.780
It's not words.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:39.660
Words can't answer that.

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:49.290
If you fix this GT-R and come back
to the Wangan, you may understand...

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:50.650
That reason.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.580
<i>It's not driving like I imagined.</i>

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:03.980
<i>Is a 1.2 boost still not enough?</i>

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:07.790
<i>I guess I still need 1.5.</i>

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:17.230
Akio, the customer at table #8 is calling you.

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:18.120
Do you know her?

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.400
Welcome.

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:26.900
Um... have we met before?

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:27.880
That's true.

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.140
I saw you a couple of times last year.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.410
Nice to meet you.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:36.770
And you haven't attended school once
since the new semester started.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.880
I'm your new homeroom teacher.

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:39.560
Eh!?

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:41.440
My name's Shimada.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.630
Remember that.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.540
Your order?

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:47.740
I want to hear your story.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.650
Then... can you wait until I'm done here?

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:58.100
Asakura Akio, 18 years old.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:01.560
Graduation was extended due to too many absences.

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:04.300
Your parents got divorced three years ago.

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:06.850
Right now, you live alone in Nakakuni.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.170
Your father runs a law firm.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.550
And your mother is a famous clothing designer.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:15.140
Even with the handicap of the divorce,

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.370
it doesn't seem like you need this job to survive.

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:24.020
So this is the reason why you
skip school and work all day?

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:29.390
Now, get on.

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:30.930
I need to see this.

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:45.210
Your attitude changes quite a bit when you get into a car.

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:47.200
What kind of car is this?

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:58.370
Z.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:08:59.430
Eh?

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:00.910
This car...

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:03.670
it's the S30Z Fairlady.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:11.170
I see now...

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:13.390
So this is what you've been doing?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.410
What's so fun about this?

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:22.230
You just drive around the same roads in circles... alone.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:23.890
I'm not alone.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.920
You're usually alone, right?

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:27.890
I'm surprised.

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.400
You were willing to be held back a year for this?

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:32.550
No, that's not what I meant.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:35.400
I'm usually with it.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.150
This Z?

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:39.970
Everyone calls it the Devil Z.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.650
Devil Z?

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:43.370
You don't have to show off.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.830
You're not gonna say it's some cursed car next, are you?

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:47.690
It's true.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.950
This car's been in many accidents...

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:51.470
It's the Devil's car.

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:54.420
How can I believe something like that.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:01.140
And I was trying to explain it to you simply.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:02.600
But I guess I'll have to show you.

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:04.400
He's here.

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:05.520
“He”?

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:07.440
The Wangan's black seabird.

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:09.530
BlackBird.

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:25.420
W-Wait, don't race him!

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:27.120
Don't worry...

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.660
It seems like he has no intention of racing.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:31.970
I can tell by the way he's driving.

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:42.010
He'll make a U-turn at Ooi and return to Kanjo-sen.

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:48.120
What's the matter, sensei?

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.650
You actually wanted to see a battle?

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.240
T-That's irrelevant.

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:55.790
Anyway, make sure you come to school tomorrow.

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.240
Ok...

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:05.910
Though he said that...

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:08.430
I probably won't see him at school today.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.000
Good morning.

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:13.470
Good morning, Shimada-sensei.

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:14.640
Yeah, good morning.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.420
Good morning, Shimada-sensei.

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:18.430
Ah! 'Morning.

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:21.680
I'm here, as promised.

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:26.190
<i>Alright!</i>

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:29.190
Ok, everyone take a seat.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.600
First, I want to introduce someone to you guys.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:34.190
He's never come to...

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:35.190
Huh?

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:38.620
Asakura-kun left already.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:43.210
He told me to let you know, he technically came to school.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:57.970
A-Akio's probably on the intersection at 3rd.

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:00.220
He goes there to tune up his car a lot.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:02.090
Thank you very much.

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:07.400
Who's that, Mah?

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.920
Akio's new homeroom teacher.

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.770
Hmm... she's pretty classy.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:15.070
Man, maybe I should've got held back a year, too.

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:17.100
Ow!

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.690
Quit spurtin' out nonsense.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.220
Hey!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.260
You're Akio-kun's homeroom teacher?

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:53.910
Yes.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:56.890
I was looking for him.

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:59.370
But it looks like you're one of his racing friends.

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:00.890
So there were a few things I wanted to ask you.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.710
No, I' not...

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.570
It's just that Tatsuya was...

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.140
Tatsuya?

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:08.200
That guy in the Porsche?

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:08.910
Yeah.

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:13.060
I really don't understand this world.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:14.820
For example, who is that guy?

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:17.830
He's a doctor... a surgeon.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:20.200
I don't understand this world even more.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.820
He has such a proper job, so why's
he so obsessed with cars?

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:27.910
Asakura-kun,too.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:30.310
His grades are really good.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.000
But if he keeps this up, he'll repeat the year again.

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:35.080
He'll be forced to quit school.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:39.770
It's like he's been overtaken by that devilish car.

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.530
Are you talking about the Z?

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:42.890
Yeah, that.

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:44.820
You must know something about it, right?

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:47.320
Why is that car called the Devil Z?

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:54.920
Originally, my older brother drove that car.

00:13:55.780 --> 00:14:00.400
Again, he was obsessed with that Z like Akio is right now.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.340
He died in an accident.

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:09.710
That Z has a lot of horsepower and it's really fast.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.140
But it's not just that...

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:15.140
There's something that transcends machinery.

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:16.280
What do you mean?

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:19.720
For example, when someone other than my brother drives it,

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:21.110
it won't go straight.

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:24.150
It's as if the car was choosing its driver.

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.060
And that car is fast like the devil...

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:31.910
Every time its owner changes, it will get into an accident.

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:36.250
And now, people call it the Devil Z.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:42.210
Everyone's after that Z.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:46.050
Especially Tatsuya, who was racing
with my brother when he died.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:49.170
He said, "I'll crush the Z".

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.420
"That's my duty as his teammate".

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:53.920
Can't you stop them?

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:57.830
At this rate, Asakura-kun and that Tatsuya-kun will...

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.690
do something they'll regret forever!

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.400
I can't stop them anymore.

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:07.740
I couldn't get Akio-kun to stop driving the Devil Z.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:16.990
How's your Testarossa doing, Ishida-sensei?

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.260
It's running fine.

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:20.000
Turn to the right a little.

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:23.630
But it loses to your GT-R.

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.110
600 horsepower you say?

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:26.340
That's amazing.

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:28.380
I know you don't honestly believe that.

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:31.500
I hear you're driving on Wangan towards the morning.

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:32.660
Sometimes...

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:36.180
I saw your Testa's on Wangan a while back.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:37.360
Really?

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:40.510
But there are quite a few Testa's out there.

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:41.890
Really now?

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:46.480
I didn't think there were many Testa's with
a white body, spoiler and sidefins.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:50.650
So you were that GT-R?

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:55.760
Just so you know, my GT-R wasn't complete back then,

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:58.540
so it won't be that easy, next time.

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:01.310
I never though that.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:05.280
Seemed like you were looking for someone, back then.

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:10.300
Could it be a really old Z?

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:14.100
Nah, I wasn't looking for anyone.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:21.310
Well thenm let's have a toast!

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:23.820
Cheers!

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:25.020
Congratulations, Ishida-san!

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.320
Congratulations!

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:30.400
No one can come close to him, when
it comes to taking pictures of girls.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:34.080
I heard Reina-chan's pictures are selling really well.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.790
Reina's really pretty, too.

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:37.820
I bet it's Ishida's pictures.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:52.600
Alright.

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.390
C'mon now...

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.120
Just 'cuz you're slender...

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.400
that part of the body is aluminum.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.400
Are you sober now, Ishida-sensei?

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.300
I didn't even had a sip.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:13.160
I was just pretending.

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:19.880
That's a pretty casual get-up.

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.240
But, I'm glad you decided to come.

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.000
The party's on the 7th floor.

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:29.640
Unfortunately, I'm not interested in partying.

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:32.250
Sensei, are you going somewhere now?

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:33.980
Not really.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.170
I get it.

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.400
You're going to Wangan, right?

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:41.320
I'm curious as to why you would go
to Wangan on a day like this...

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:46.650
Rather, I'm interested in the old Z you're looking for, sensei.

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:48.820
The Z that belongs to the devil.

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:50.300
Devil...?

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.390
I see, so it's that kind of car?

00:17:58.100 --> 00:17:59.110
Do you believe it?

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:00.290
I have no choice.

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:01.960
After seeing power like that.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:06.500
Two weeks ago, I first saw him here.

00:18:10.930 --> 00:18:13.760
I was overtaken by that Z like nothing.

00:18:14.810 --> 00:18:17.040
And I couldn't catch up, no matter how hard I tried.

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:22.220
I can't forget that Z.

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.640
I want to race with him again.

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:27.640
Like a dying plant yearning for water.

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:30.270
My whole body wants to race him.

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:35.570
That line didn't suit me, I know...

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:37.870
No, but...

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:42.410
Maybe that Z will save me.

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:43.870
Save?

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:44.830
Yeah.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:47.590
For some reason, I can be honest with you...

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:49.710
I'm ill.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:50.880
Eh?

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:53.550
It's either gastro or my esophagus... probably.

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:54.950
No way!

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:57.290
You need to go to a hospital and get examined.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:58.670
I'm sure you would understand.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:03.650
We try to be bright on the outside, but we're all lonely.

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:08.070
But, I feel different when I drive here.

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:12.900
Money and fame means nothing.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:15.900
I just want to keep racing here.

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.360
That's how I feel.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.410
It's like I can truly feel alive.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:23.810
Those few minutes I'm chasing the Z.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:29.070
Right now, more than anything, he made me feel alive.

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:36.210
That's what I meant when I said the Devil Z will save me.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:45.690
I knew it!

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:47.190
I was waiting for you.

00:19:50.490 --> 00:19:51.990
Sensei, you're pretty persistent.

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:53.480
Don't you have anything better to do?

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:56.240
Chasing after me like this...

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:13.530
<i>Why am I so persistent?</i>

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:16.420
<i>Because I feel responsible as his homeroom teacher?</i>

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.010
<i>Or is it...</i>

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:27.270
<i>The devil's gotten into me...?</i>

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:38.410
So who's the driver of this "devil's car" with a history?

00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:40.710
You'll find out soon enough.

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:41.910
You might be surprised.

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:52.750
They look pretty dumb.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:01.270
These guys are annoying!

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:03.310
I wanna battle them so badly!

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:05.650
It happens a lot when I'm driving this.

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:07.060
Why don't you go for it?

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:09.440
That R doesn't look that fast.

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:11.420
Leave them alone and they'll be gone.

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:13.140
You're so mature.

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:14.930
I couldn't do that.

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:22.440
Eh? Why so suddenly?

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:24.590
Look at the car merging from the right.

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:25.700
Eh?

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.080
Z!

00:21:33.630 --> 00:21:34.450
Bastard!

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:38.570
W-What's this car?

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.280
It's pretty famous.

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:42.400
It's a Ferrari.

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:44.310
<i>He's...</i>

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:46.420
That's not what I meant.

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:47.410
Do you know him?

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.390
No way... someone that amazing?

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:51.390
But I know the girl in the passenger's seat.

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:52.480
What?!

00:21:52.760 --> 00:21:53.820
He's pretty young.

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:55.120
Surprising, isn't it?

00:21:58.270 --> 00:22:00.120
Oh, so he wants to play?

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:02.650
Play? What do you mean?

00:22:03.140 --> 00:22:04.240
Don't tell me you're...

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:24.110
That R is chasing us.

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:27.510
That's kind of dangerous.

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:28.610
Are you ok?

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:31.270
They think they can just smoke me?

00:22:31.610 --> 00:22:33.810
This baby's got 450 horsepower.

00:22:35.210 --> 00:22:36.530
<i>So, you're coming, R?</i>

00:22:37.480 --> 00:22:40.820
<i>Indeed, it's a good car... fast and easy to ride.</i>

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:43.920
<i>But are you sure you got it under control, kid?</i>

00:22:46.060 --> 00:22:47.520
I'll take 'em both from the left!

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:49.210
First is the Testa'!

00:22:51.210 --> 00:22:52.410
And next, the Z!

00:22:55.820 --> 00:22:56.750
How was that?!

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:01.110
See ya later!

00:23:01.800 --> 00:23:02.760
Hey!
